        "body": "Moderate update (summary file columns are changed)\r\n- update mlst to 2.35.0\r\n- update amrfinder to 4.2.7-2026-10-29.1\r\n- update pandas to 3.1.0\r\n- update datasets to 18.39.0\r\n- update elgato to 1.24.1\r\n- update fastp to 1.4.0\r\n- update fastqc to 0.13.0\r\n- update iqtree3 to 3.1.4\r\n- allows meningotype finetype failure\r\n\r\nSummary column changes\r\n- `quast_total_length` added\r\n- `mlst_matching_pubmlst_scheme` -> `mlst_scheme`\r\n- `mlst_score` added\r\n- `fastqc_flagged_sequences` removed",
